Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 00:16:35 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Add double tap to sleep gesture

Allow double tapping the status bar or empty keyguard space to turn off
the screen. Ignores gesture when the primary bouncer (PIN/Pattern entry)
is showing or while dozing.

